  "abstract": "Builds on RC-DualDecay by adding a temporal curvature regularizer (L2 on second differences across the 32-step horizon) to encourage smooth, stable long-horizon forecasts. Keeps residual copy head for short horizons and low-rank neuron coupling. Uses global-norm gradient clipping with Adam for stability.",
